(text
"Default links preserve the existing passive input network. Optional daughterboard must buffer BOTH P/N with matched transfer functions.\nPower budget for the two analog rails is limited; verify load, headroom, offset, input noise and stability before fitting an amplifier.\nNo automatic filter matching is claimed. Keep all external AFE and OLED supplies floating in the system domain.\nOLED connector is 3.3V only; no display driver is enabled in current firmware. LEDs use static/slow GPIO, no PWM."
